- Update to 0.2.34:
  * Eager backend: new conv3d and group_norm_pad3d modules plus
    persistent RoPE allocation handling; faster
    apply_rope_split_half1
  * CUDA/HIP MiniMax H3 VAE kernels (fused encoder pad/norm,
